CONSUMER-FAILURE EXCEPTION REMAINS NARROW
This run again observed producer exit1/null and structured EPIPE/write/errno-32
as the same actual stdout error through non-handling errorMonitor and
uncaughtExceptionMonitor, bound to caller token/PID context. The exact consumer
failure reached settlement after16chunks. Unchanged terminal predicate accepted
structured-closed-consumer-EPIPE. This does not extend that exception to timeout
or allocation and does not retroactively validate v3.1 timeout stderr text.

